@startuml
title Abstract Game - State Machine

[*] --> IN_PROGRESS : createInitialState(players)

IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS : handleAction(PlayerAction)\n[validateMove() == true,\nisGameOver() == false]\n/ playerTurn switches

IN_PROGRESS --> P1_WIN : handleAction(PlayerAction)\n[isGameOver() == true,\nPLAYER_1 wins]

IN_PROGRESS --> P2_WIN : handleAction(PlayerAction)\n[isGameOver() == true,\nPLAYER_2 wins]

IN_PROGRESS --> TIE : handleAction(PlayerAction)\n[isGameOver() == true,\nno winner]

note right of IN_PROGRESS
  handleAction() is a no-op if
  validateMove() returns false
end note

P1_WIN --> [*]
P2_WIN --> [*]
TIE --> [*]

@enduml